theme_override_constants/line_spacing = 8
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("4")
text = "        However, if we are to get one primary takeaway from this year's bullcrap, then the main highlight of SONA is undoubtedly the image your eyes just laid upon above. Come on, I mean, look at this dress! Senator Nancy Binay grabbed the attentions of netizens as her morning outfit before the highly anticipated SONA 2014 of President Aquino generated memes online. Some netizens posted photos of the Senator comparing her attire to a hot air balloon and other comical characters when she was spotted wearing a Randy Ortiz creation."
